//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular MPS, MPO, DMRG, TEBD, TDVP, PEPS, MERA, TRG, and many-body Hamiltonian submodules.
//   2. Re-export public quantum tensor network configurations, factory constructors, and algorithm shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA quantum applications.

